For large vectors, using `find()` can have performance implications due to its linear time complexity. To optimize for large vectors, one could consider implementing a hash table or binary search tree data structure for faster lookups. However, keep in mind that such optimizations would involve additional coding effort and memory overhead compared to the STL approach shown here."]

