The function leverages a remote service for computation if available and preferred, falls back to local computation if necessary, ensuring minimal latency and resource usage. It also manages concurrent access issues when sharing the logging service by multiple threads. The code is robust against race conditions and network failures, retrying operations up to a specified limit before switching to local computation if the remote service is unavailable.

