The class provides methods for generating random integers within specified ranges, random floating-point numbers, and a method to report the current number of active generators. The implementation should be robust against high-frequency calls from multiple threads by using appropriate synchronization mechanisms such as thread-local storage (the `std::thread::id` member variable).

