The code includes exception handling, logging, and proper memory management using an `ObjectInputStream`. Additionally, it is designed to support integration with a distributed cache for faster access to frequently loaded states and scales horizontally to accommodate increased load demands using a message queue to notify other components of successful or failed load operations.']

